# [fn [let ...xs] xs] can be called with multiple positional arguments.
# Unannotated ...xs collects all positional args into a Dict (integer-keyed) at runtime.
# Dict({}) is the empty variadic (nil sentinel). Non-empty: Dict({Int(0): v0, ...}).
# The type checker infers the type of xs from usage patterns.
[f: [fn [let ...xs] xs]
 result: [f 10 20 30]]
=== out
["f": [fn [let xs] ...]  "result": [10  20  30]]
